# Reckless Lackey (CR 702.10a haste, CR 702.7b first strike): Bot1 casts it on turn 1 and attacks at once with it (haste), Bot2 at 19. On turn 3 it attacks
# into Bot2's Memnite (1/1): the Lackey (1/2) deals its damage first and kills the blocker, which never deals damage back, so the Lackey is undamaged.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Ruby
Reckless Lackey
Island x18

[Bot2 Deck]
Memnite
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Reckless Lackey.Cast
[T1 Bot1.DeclareAttackers]
Bot1.Attack(Reckless Lackey > Bot2)
[T1 Bot1.Main2]
? Bot2.Life = 19
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Memnite.Cast
[T3 Bot1.DeclareAttackers]
Bot1.Attack(Reckless Lackey > Bot2)
Bot2.Block(Memnite > Reckless Lackey)
[T3 Bot1.Main2]

[Expect]
Bot2.Battlefield.Memnite = (absent)
Bot2.Graveyard = Memnite
Bot1.Battlefield.Reckless Lackey.Damage = 0
Bot2.Life = 19
